ask_s1 (c = s1a, m = 2022-01) [mc_round = gr_down | gr_half_up]: (119.41 PLN, ?"The simulation doesn't say whether the employee filed the PIT-2 statement of art. 32 ust. 3." (pit2_filed[s1a]) ?"The simulation's costs and social insurance contributions are not stated; it says only that it takes the basic flat-rate costs into account." (month_income[s1a]), ?"The simulation doesn't say whether the employee filed the PIT-2 statement of art. 32 ust. 3." (pit2_filed[s1a]) ?"The simulation's costs and social insurance contributions are not stated; it says only that it takes the basic flat-rate costs into account." (month_income[s1a]), ?"The 2021 law behind the MF simulation's '2021 rules' columns is not among the case's sources." (adv_2021[s1a, 2022-01]))
  assumed: no example mentions a request under art. 32 ust. 2b (waiver[s1a])
  pinned: mon_relief[c, m] = 0 for c in [s1a, s1b], m in mo
